## Import

Import an existing graph variant with its graph identifier and variant name:

```terraform
import {
  to = apollo_graph_variant.production
  id = "inventory:production"
}
```

## Permissions

- Read, import, and refresh require graph read or broader org access.
- Delete requires graph admin or broader org access.
